---
// Pediatric Cancer Research Foundation (Copy) — programmatic rebuild
// via typed blocks (Phase 3 migration).
// Source: https://wordpress-1227270-4701771.cloudwaysapps.com/tpp/pediatric-cancer-research-foundation-copy/
// Data:   src/data/pages/pediatric-cancer-research-foundation-copy.json
// Renderer: src/components/TypedPage.astro
//
// Four sections, two new block types (+ two reused from /give-courage/):
//
// Section 1 (#brxe-rsrqon): victory-form-section — H2 "Victory Over Cancer"
//   + body left, 3-field contact form right. Live source uses Bricks
//   default form handler with no clear backend wired. This migration
//   falls back to a mailto: link assembled on submit (recipient split
//   across data-mu/data-md attributes — same anti-scraping pattern as
//   src/components/MailtoLink.astro). Phase 6 CAR: wire to GHL widget.
// Section 2 (#brxe-855247): pcrf-section (REUSED from /give-courage/
//   Section 3) — eyebrow + H1 + body (with inline #caa949 link color
//   preserved verbatim) + Rainbow-for-Erin image + caption. Variant:
//   H1 has no color span (vs Give Courage's pink emphasis).
// Section 3 (#brxe-4e248a): join-movement (REUSED from /give-courage/
//   Section 6) — image left + H2 + 3 paragraphs right. Variant: no
//   pink-bold final paragraph and no John & Karen Vallely attribution.
// Section 4 (#brxe-c7589c): pcrf-cta-section — H2 + 3-up H3 grid +
//   PCRF logo + donate link, all centered.
//
// Asset migration (2026-05-14):
//   LogoNew-300x196-1.png migrated to Sanity asset
//   b92b725506bd9c71c0b5faf65e088085511859c2-300x196. The other three
//   images (Rainbow for Erin, join-the-movement, etc.) were already
//   in sanity-images.json from prior migrations.
//
// CARs (carried forward to Phase 5/6):
//   - Page slug "pediatric-cancer-research-foundation-copy" looks like
//     an accidental WP "Duplicate page" artifact (the "-copy" suffix
//     is what WP auto-appends on Duplicate). Flag for Kevin: should
//     this page exist? Should it be renamed (/pcrf/, /victory-over-cancer/)?
//     Should the content be merged into /give-courage/?
//   - Contact form backend is mailto: fallback (kevin@spiritmediapublishing.com).
//     Phase 6: wire to proper form handler — most likely a GHL widget
//     per the rest of the site's CTAs (mail.spiritmediaone.com).
//   - Variant content vs /give-courage/'s same-named sections (different
//     H1 color, different closing paragraph). Verify with Kevin if
//     these are intentional or if this page should mirror Give Courage.
//   - "please" typo in Section 3 closing ("...mission, and please for
//     a cure" — likely should be "plea"). Preserved verbatim per Phase 3.
//   - Inline link color #caa949 on Section 2 link is a darker gold
//     variant of brand yellow. Preserved verbatim per Phase 3.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TypedPage from '../components/TypedPage.astro';
import blocks from '../data/pages/pediatric-cancer-research-foundation-copy.json';

const meta = (blocks as any[]).find(b => b.type === '_meta') || {};
---
<Layout title={meta.title || 'Pediatric Cancer Research Foundation | The Pyramid Principle'}
        description={meta.description || ''}>
  <TypedPage blocks={blocks as any[]} />
</Layout>
